Third-party attributions
------------------------

No third-party source code is vendored into this repository. All runtime and
development dependencies are declared in pyproject.toml and installed from their
upstream distributions under their own licences.

Any dataset, benchmark, or model artifact that forecheck is configured to consume
carries its own licence and usage restrictions. Those are recorded, per artifact, in
docs/license-matrix.md and enforced at load time by the
forecheck.contracts.records.SourceLicense field: records marked eval_only, or bearing
a benchmark canary, are refused by the training and calibration data loaders.
